        "original_id": "8c8ae2be-9eff-5d49-8c11-c84e8877d6f9",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game, Yu-Gi-Oh! Official Card Game\n- Companies: Konami\n- People: Kazuki Takahashi\n- Concepts: Duel Monsters, game design\n- Topics: collectible card games, game creation\n\nFacts:\n- Konami developed and published the Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game, which is known in Asia as the Yu-Gi-Oh! Official Card Game.\n- The Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game is a Japanese collectible card game.\n- Kazuki Takahashi created the fictional game Duel Monsters.\n- Duel Monsters is the main plot device for most of the Yu-Gi-Oh! manga franchise.\n- The Yu-Gi-Oh! Trading Card Game is based on Duel Monsters.\n- Game design is the art of applying design and aesthetics to create games for entertainment, education, exercise, or experimentation.",
